{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "babyincar-api-collection",
    "name": "Baby in Car API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Baby in Car app - AI-powered baby soothing sounds for car rides.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Set up environment variables (see Environment section)\n2. Run Register or Login to get tokens\n3. Tokens are automatically set via collection scripts\n\n## Features\n\n- User authentication (email & Apple Sign-In)\n- Baby profile management\n- Audio content catalog\n- AI-powered recommendations (Workers AI / Llama 3.1)\n- Analytics & effectiveness tracking\n- Subscription management",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-refresh token if expired (basic check)",
          "const tokenExpiry = pm.environment.get('token_expiry');",
          "if (tokenExpiry && Date.now() > parseInt(tokenExpiry)) {",
          "    console.log('Token may be expired, consider refreshing');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8787",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
